{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And now, O Israel, hear the statutes and the judgments which I teach you to do, that you may live.</b> We learn from here that study is not the essence but only with action, and so our Rabbis of blessed memory expounded: 'The study is not the essence but the action.' And we learn further that through action a person lives, and not without it."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:45:06.679436193Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}